Ernesto Guevara (&lt;a href="14%20Juni"&gt;14 Juni&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1928"&gt;1928&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="9%20Oktober"&gt;9 Oktober&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1967"&gt;1967&lt;/a&gt;), biyasa dikenal minangka Che Guevara, El Che utawa mung Che waé, yakuwi sawijining tokoh pulitik &lt;a href="revolution%C3%A8r"&gt;revolutionèr&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Marxist"&gt;Marxist&lt;/a&gt;, lan pamimpin gerilya &lt;a href="Cuba"&gt;Cuba&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Proletarian%20internationalisme"&gt;internationalist&lt;/a&gt; klairan &lt;a href="Argentina"&gt;Argentine&lt;/a&gt;
