Mochtar Lubis

Mochtar Lubis, lair ing &lt;a href="Padang"&gt;Padang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sumatra%20Kulon"&gt;Sumatra Kulon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="7%20Maret"&gt;7 Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1922"&gt;1922&lt;/a&gt;, satunggiling &lt;a href="sastrawan"&gt;sastrawan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; mantan &lt;a href="wartawan"&gt;wartawan&lt;/a&gt; ingkang ndèrèk ngadegaken LKBN Antara. Naté mimpin Harian &lt;a href="Indonesia%20Raya"&gt;Indonesia Raya&lt;/a&gt; wiwit &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1951"&gt;1951&lt;/a&gt; ngatos koran kala wau dipunlarang terbit ing taun &lt;a href="1974"&gt;1974&lt;/a&gt;. Amargi seratan-seratanipun ing koran kasebat, piyambakipun lajeng dipunkunjara salami sedasa taun (&lt;a href="1956-66"&gt;1956-66&lt;/a&gt;) déning Pamaréntah Orde Lama. Wiwit taun &lt;a href="1966"&gt;1966&lt;/a&gt;, piyambakipun mimpin kalawarti sastra &lt;a href="Horison"&gt;Horison&lt;/a&gt;. Mochtar Lubis minangka Ketua Yayasan Indonesia naté nampi Penghargaan &lt;a href="Magsaysay"&gt;Magsaysay&lt;/a&gt; saking Pamaréntah &lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1958"&gt;1958&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Pena%20Emas"&gt;Pena Emas&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="World%20Federation%20of%20Editor%20and%20Publisher"&gt;World Federation of Editor and Publisher&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1967"&gt;1967&lt;/a&gt;), lan &lt;a href="Bebungah%20Sastra%20Chairil%20Anwar"&gt;Bebungah Sastra Chairil Anwar&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;) saking &lt;a href="Dewan%20Kesenian%20Jakarta"&gt;Dewan Kesenian Jakarta&lt;/a&gt;. 
