<doc id="18414" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18414" title="Jana-Gana-Mana">
Jana-Gana-Mana

Jana-Gana-Mana (&lt;a href="aksara%20Dewanagari"&gt;aksara Dewanagari&lt;/a&gt; जन गण मन) iku &lt;a href="lagu%20kabangsan"&gt;lagu kabangsan&lt;/a&gt;é &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;. Minangka 5 gatra pisanan saka geguritan anggitane pujangga Bengali misuwur &lt;a href="Rabindranath%20Tagore"&gt;Rabindranath Tagore&lt;/a&gt;.
