Pheng Xat Lao

Pheng Xat Lao iku &lt;a href="lagu%20kabangsan"&gt;lagu kabangsan&lt;/a&gt;é &lt;a href="Laos"&gt;Laos&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Thongdy%20Sounthonevichit"&gt;Dr Thongdy Sounthonevichit&lt;/a&gt; nggawe iramane lan nulis syaire ing taun 1941. Lagu iki dadi lagu kabangsane &lt;a href="Krajan%20Laos"&gt;Praja Laos&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1945. Syair asline dianyari sawise &lt;a href="Pathet%20Lao"&gt;Pathet Lao&lt;/a&gt; menang ing &lt;a href="Perang%20Sipil%20Laos"&gt;Perang Sipil Laos&lt;/a&gt; lan Republik Dhemokratik Rakyat Laos diadegake ing taun 1975, kanthi syair anyar kang ditulis dening &lt;a href="Sisana%20Sisane"&gt;Sisana Sisane&lt;/a&gt;. 
<h2>Tèks</h2>
Tèks.
"Xat Lao tang té dai ma
Lao thoukthoua na xeutxou soutchai
Houamhéng houamchit houamchai
Samakkhi kan pén kamlang diao
Détdiao pom kan kaona
Bouxa xou kiat khong Lao
Sôngseum xai sit pén chao
Lao thouk xônphao sameu phap kan
Bo hai phouak chakkaphout 
Lé phouak khayxat khaoma lôp kouan
Lao thang mouan xou ékalat
Itsalaphap khong xat Lao vai
Tat sinchai sou xing ao xai
Pha xat Lao pai sou khouam vatthana."
<h2>Alihbasa</h2>
